# pages-smoke (t-pages): the web smoke's hover state. main.py's web() still loads the
# Odin tar's hover-row-1, which t0-harness deleted (it never existed in this repo), so the
# smoke never ran here. This state replaces it: the pointer onto row a's name (216, 450:
# row a's centre at 1440x900, as rows-hover-a), one frame later a lit in the row and in
# both readout lines through the sync, with a rest shot first so the smoke holds that
# nothing outside the lit regions changed.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
shot rest
move 216 450
wait 200
shot hover
